      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "For the greatest number, there is no reason to put a smaller digit before a larger one.\n\nArrange:\n\n7 > 5 > 2 > 0\n\nSo:\n\n7,520\n\nThe fastest method is simply descending order when there is no leading-zero problem.",
